value":" ，容器内气体温度与容器外相同（状态1）。现对安装在容器下部的电热丝通以电流，让其加热气体，使活塞缓慢上升到达卡槽。当活塞对卡槽施加的压力达到100N时（状态2），减压阀自动打开，容器缓慢释放气体，容器内气体的温度保持不变，直至活塞对卡槽的压力减至0。此时，关闭阀门，容器内气体不再外泄。已知外界压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=0.99 \\times 10^{5} Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" ，环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}=27^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n(1)减压阀自动打开后，气体分子热运动的平均速率"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":" (选填“增大”、“不变”或“减小”），单位时间内撞击单位面积容器壁的分子数"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（选填“增多”、“减少”或“不变”）；(2)求在状态1时容器内气体的压强和状态2时容器内气体的温度；(3)若从状态1到状态2过程中，容器内气体吸收的热量Q=201J，求此过程中气体的内能变化量。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/15997bebef8d5a8abc909db85300afeb16900f54f61f91f58bb5308f521c92d5.png","width":316,"height":272,"width_mm":36.96,"row_group":"taizhou-ermo-2604-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"（1）不变　减少"},{"type":"score","value":"（2 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）状态 1，"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=(p_1-p_0)S"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1=1\\times10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n状态 2，"},{"type":"math","value":"mg+F+p_0S=p_2S"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2=1.1\\times10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n状态 1 到状态 2，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_1V_1}{T_1}=\\frac{p_2V_2}{T_2}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"T_2=396\\mathrm K"},{"type":"score","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q"},{"type":"score","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"math","value":"W=-p_1Sh_2=-40\\m